1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:30,000
= kissasia.co =

2
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:03,100
"Kiss Or Kill"

3
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,000
(Episode 8)

4
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:14,840
Then will you be the next Lin Cang?

5
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,120
No.

6
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,359
Then that settles it.

7
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,400
As long as it's not you,

8
00:01:19,519 --> 00:01:21,680
I'll kill everyone else.

9
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,400
Remember,

10
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:31,879
I'll always be by your side.

11
00:01:41,079 --> 00:01:42,120
If this path

12
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:44,959
leads to a dead end,

13
00:01:45,519 --> 00:01:46,920
will you still follow me?

14
00:01:50,439 --> 00:01:51,439
Of course.

15
00:02:06,879 --> 00:02:08,240
You don't believe me?

16
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Answer me.

17
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:55,479
I don't want you walking
into a death trap with me.

18
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,719
You don't have a choice.

19
00:06:35,399 --> 00:06:36,399
Look up.

20
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,800
What for?

21
00:06:39,079 --> 00:06:40,079
I'm sleepy.

22
00:06:40,319 --> 00:06:41,319
You're this exhausted?

23
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:44,639
Want me to give you a
massage to help you relax?

24
00:06:45,839 --> 00:06:47,560
You really never get tired.

25
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,120
You bet.

26
00:06:49,399 --> 00:06:50,360
We're just getting started.

27
00:06:50,399 --> 00:06:51,799
We've got a long night ahead of us.

28
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:53,800
Nie Chuan.

29
00:06:55,759 --> 00:06:56,759
You're so good to me.

30
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,480
You looked for me for three years.

31
00:07:00,839 --> 00:07:01,839
Why?

32
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:05,200
Haven't you been thinking
about me for three years too?

33
00:07:06,879 --> 00:07:08,360
You talk too much.

34
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:13,199
Don't disappear again, okay?

35
00:08:00,199 --> 00:08:01,199
You want to run?

36
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,199
I'm back now, aren't I?

37
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:13,120
If something's on your mind,

38
00:08:13,879 --> 00:08:14,920
don't hide it from me.

39
00:08:16,079 --> 00:08:17,439
What could possibly be on my mind?

40
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:18,960
I just went out for some fresh air.

41
00:08:20,959 --> 00:08:22,279
You sure know how to pick a spot.

42
00:08:22,399 --> 00:08:24,159
There are a lot of wild
berries around here.

43
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,640
Some of them are pretty sour.

44
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,120
Just as I thought.

45
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:53,840
Still very sour.

46
00:09:17,519 --> 00:09:18,519
I don't think so.

47
00:09:35,559 --> 00:09:36,559
How about this time?

48
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,480
Second Uncle.

49
00:10:44,159 --> 00:10:45,519
Three days ago in the afternoon,

50
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,639
who were you with?

51
00:10:49,879 --> 00:10:50,879
I...

52
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:53,120
I was with Nie Chuan.

53
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:58,279
You never were any good at lying.

54
00:11:01,919 --> 00:11:03,159
I was wrong, Second Uncle.

55
00:11:03,919 --> 00:11:05,960
Whose idea was this anyway?

56
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,480
I was just curious.

57
00:11:09,039 --> 00:11:10,320
The Black Moon Society's deals,

58
00:11:10,919 --> 00:11:13,039
the government forces will
crack down harder on them.

59
00:11:13,759 --> 00:11:15,480
But you never seem worried, Second Uncle.

60
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,159
So I...

61
00:11:21,879 --> 00:11:23,679
Now you know why.

62
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:25,080
I know I messed up.

63
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:26,799
I got ahead of myself.

64
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:30,320
I thought I could handle it all on my own.

65
00:11:30,919 --> 00:11:31,919
Now I realize.

66
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,160
I bit off more than I could chew.

67
00:11:34,879 --> 00:11:35,879
Good that you know.

68
00:11:36,879 --> 00:11:38,080
You're my child.

69
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,759
What parent in this world

70
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:43,480
wouldn't forgive their child's mistakes?

71
00:11:44,919 --> 00:11:45,919
Thank you, Second Uncle.

72
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,639
However, there is one thing.

73
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:51,559
Go ahead.

74
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:53,559
That guy by your side...

75
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:55,560
He's a bad influence on you.

76
00:11:56,559 --> 00:11:58,039
Make him disappear.

77
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:08,879
All right, I will.

78
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:14,320
In Song Peng's jurisdiction,

79
00:12:14,399 --> 00:12:16,320
this is the only route Lin Cang can take.

80
00:12:17,639 --> 00:12:18,639
Right here.

81
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,375
I've looked into it thoroughly.

82
00:12:21,399 --> 00:12:22,599
The intel is absolutely solid.

83
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:24,000
Aren't I amazing?

84
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,336
Where did you get this information?

85
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,559
I have my own sources.

86
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:31,480
You're keeping secrets from me.

87
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:36,160
From the very beginning, you approached me

88
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,120
just for this.

89
00:12:38,399 --> 00:12:39,399
No, I didn't.

90
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:41,679
You still doubt me even now?

91
00:12:41,799 --> 00:12:42,840
Then who exactly are you?

92
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:48,200
Forget it.

93
00:12:48,879 --> 00:12:49,879
Lin Yan.

94
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:22,679
He still doesn't believe

95
00:13:22,759 --> 00:13:23,840
the information I gave him.

96
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,120
I'll go sort it out.

97
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:10,320
What are you doing here?

98
00:15:14,919 --> 00:15:16,360
I'm sleeping here tonight.

99
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,320
I want you to stay.

100
00:15:25,559 --> 00:15:26,559
Get out.

101
00:15:27,519 --> 00:15:28,895
You've been avoiding
me for three days.

102
00:15:28,919 --> 00:15:29,919
Give me an explanation.

103
00:15:30,399 --> 00:15:31,399
I'm bored of you.

104
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,320
Say that again.

105
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:46,399
You're just a tool to cure my loneliness.

106
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:49,039
I've had enough and want a new one.

107
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:50,320
You're lying.

108
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:51,879
Are you planning to

109
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,560
go after Lin Cang alone again?

110
00:15:53,873 --> 00:15:55,513
You're afraid Song Peng will protect him.

111
00:15:55,559 --> 00:15:57,296
You're afraid I'll get
dragged in and killed.

112
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:58,320
I've seen it all.

113
00:15:58,679 --> 00:16:00,039
You think I'm scared of Song Peng?

114
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:01,679
You're too full of yourself.

115
00:16:03,159 --> 00:16:04,199
Or do you just want money?

116
00:16:05,799 --> 00:16:06,799
Two hundred thousand?

117
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,360
Five hundred thousand?

118
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,600
Or a million?

119
00:16:13,519 --> 00:16:14,519
Forget it.

120
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:17,120
I suppose I could sleep
with you one more night.

121
00:16:17,679 --> 00:16:18,679
Come on.

122
00:16:21,519 --> 00:16:22,519
Damn it.

123
00:16:27,279 --> 00:16:28,559
I don't need you anyway.

124
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:36,600
You're nothing but a coward.

125
00:16:44,399 --> 00:16:46,159
We're not from the same world.

126
00:16:47,039 --> 00:16:48,039
Nie Chuan.

127
00:16:49,120 --> 00:16:50,120
Don't hate me.

128
00:17:48,119 --> 00:17:51,160
The goods you stashed are right here.

129
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,240
What are you talking about?

130
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:57,440
Stop pretending.

131
00:17:57,960 --> 00:17:59,280
I figured it out a long time ago.

132
00:18:02,400 --> 00:18:03,480
I've held back for so long.

133
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:05,320
I don't want to hold back anymore.

134
00:18:05,519 --> 00:18:08,880
Haven't you ever thought about going solo?

135
00:18:09,759 --> 00:18:11,039
You're digging your own grave.

136
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:12,279
Don't drag me into this.

137
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,279
You think you can keep these goods hidden?

138
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:19,880
Second Uncle has known for a while.

139
00:18:22,079 --> 00:18:23,160
You think he doesn't know?

140
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:25,079
What do you want to do?

141
00:18:25,279 --> 00:18:26,640
Exactly what you're thinking.

142
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,400
Watch closely.

143
00:18:40,799 --> 00:18:41,799
Is this enough?

144
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:55,960
Thirty-seventy.

145
00:18:56,359 --> 00:18:57,359
Then I get seventy.

146
00:18:57,599 --> 00:18:58,599
Forty-sixty.

147
00:18:58,880 --> 00:18:59,880
I get sixty.

148
00:19:00,079 --> 00:19:01,199
The northern route is yours.

149
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:07,960
Deal.

150
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:19,200
You saw that.

151
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:20,920
Go away.

152
00:19:22,079 --> 00:19:23,240
Know when to back down.

153
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:26,240
So from the very beginning,

154
00:19:27,559 --> 00:19:29,599
it was all just wishful
thinking on my part.

155
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:35,000
Don't move.

156
00:19:43,839 --> 00:19:45,015
Brother Scorpion, this
guy was eavesdropping.

157
00:19:45,039 --> 00:19:46,119
What should we do with him?

158
00:19:51,599 --> 00:19:52,599
Did you bring him?

159
00:19:53,079 --> 00:19:54,079
No.

160
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:56,640
Then...

161
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:58,640
What do you want to do?

162
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:01,920
The route is compromised.

163
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:03,680
He's of no value anymore.

164
00:20:04,279 --> 00:20:05,999
Since he delivered himself to our doorstep,

165
00:20:06,039 --> 00:20:07,079
let's get rid of him.

166
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:08,400
A-yan.

167
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:13,839
We should have done this a long time ago.

168
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:15,640
Wait.

169
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:17,960
What is it now?

170
00:20:18,799 --> 00:20:20,095
If we just get rid of him like this,

171
00:20:20,119 --> 00:20:21,440
and Lin Cang finds out,

172
00:20:22,599 --> 00:20:23,640
won't our cover be blown?

173
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:24,920
Then what's your plan?

174
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:27,680
Lock him up first.

175
00:20:28,039 --> 00:20:29,799
We'll deal with him
after the trade is done.

176
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:32,160
After all this time,

177
00:20:32,759 --> 00:20:33,960
you've been lying to me.

178
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:36,160
I didn't expect

179
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:39,839
you to trust me so easily.

180
00:20:47,799 --> 00:20:48,400
Lin Yan.

181
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:48,920
Let's go.

182
00:20:49,319 --> 00:20:50,319
Hang in there.

183
00:21:25,279 --> 00:21:26,440
You're just one step away.

184
00:21:41,960 --> 00:21:44,279
He's not like us.

185
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:49,079
He won't stay.
